          "categories": [
            {
              "category": "approved",
              "description": "=The post has been reviewed and accepted as-is. The human explicitly or implicitly expresses approval, indicating that no changes are needed.  Example phrases include:  \"Looks good.\" \"Go ahead and send it.\" \"This works for me.\" \"Approved.\" \"No changes needed.\""
            },
            {
              "category": "declined",
              "description": "=The post has been reviewed, but the human requests modifications before it is sent like tweaks, removing parts, rewording, etc. This could include suggested edits, rewording, or major revisions.  Example phrases include:  \"Can we tweak this part?\" \"make it shorter\" \"change the source to 'American Kennel Club'\" \"more emojis\""
